# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in values as needed:
#
#   cp .env.example .env
#
# Everything here is OPTIONAL for local development. With no .env at all the
# app still runs end to end: generated PDFs are written to tmp/pdf_output/ and
# served directly. Only set these if you specifically want to exercise the S3
# integration locally.

# --- AWS S3 (optional) ------------------------------------------------------
# Leave these unset to use local filesystem storage for generated PDFs.
# Set ALL of them (AWS_BUCKET is what flips the app into S3 mode) to store
# PDFs in S3 and serve them via presigned URLs, matching production.
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=
# AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=
# AWS_REGION=us-west-2
# AWS_BUCKET=your-bucket-name
